beats.body:
`ALTER TABLE` changes the **structure** of a table:
```sql
ALTER TABLE table_name ADD column_name datatype;
ALTER TABLE table_name RENAME COLUMN c1 TO c2;
ALTER TABLE table_name DROP COLUMN column_name;
```
